// Chained KEEPs intersect their patterns, and an all-literal KEEP contributes no pattern at all, so the intersection collapses to NONE:
// no _unmapped_fields column is planned and the query degenerates to exactly what LOAD would run. The end-to-end reference for that
// early-out; the pattern algebra itself is covered by DetermineUnmappedFieldsToKeepTests.
